"The changes run as a %@-minute trial. If you don't confirm, the device rolls back on its own, even if you lose the connection." = "Zmeny bežia ako %@-minútová skúška. Ak ich nepotvrdíte, zariadenie sa samo vráti späť, aj keď stratíte pripojenie.";
"The device checks each command as it is applied" = "Zariadenie kontroluje každý príkaz pri jeho použití";
"The device didn't accept the commands" = "Zariadenie neprijalo príkazy";
"The device is checking the changes" = "Zariadenie kontroluje zmeny";
